# Keys that scripts/live-round.sh generates for a testnet round. A link's secret key IS the money
# in it: never commit this folder (the former standalone repository ignored it; the rule has to
# travel with the crate).
scripts/.keys/
# cargo output. The monorepo's root .gitignore covers **/target/ as well; kept here so the crate
# is safe when checked out or copied on its own.
target/
